  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole robust low-bodied mammal with a large head and strong jaws, reconstructed mainly from IVPP V14155, with explicitly comparative hand/foot reconstruction from congeneric R.robustus.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"V14155 preserves partial skull and articulated postcranium, but lacks manus and pes. Short broad plantigrade hands/feet are inferred using R.robustus V13605, not directly preserved in the modeled individual. Fur, ears, color and flesh are inferred. Tail364mm is preserved length, not certified complete tail. Mass12-14kg is regression estimate. Dinosaur stomach remains belong to R.robustus, not V14155.\",\"zh\":\"V14155保存部分颅骨与关联骨架，但手足缺失。短宽跖行手足按同属R.robustus V13605比较推断，并非目标个体实证。毛、耳、颜色及软组织为复原；364毫米是保存尾长，非完整尾长保证。12至14千克为回归估计；恐龙胃内容物属于R.robustus，不属于V14155。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":661,\"taxon\":\"Repenomamus giganticus\",\"classification\":\"Eutriconodonta, Mammalia; extinct non-therian mammal, not a modern badger or rodent\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"published_skull_m\":0.16,\"published_trunk_m\":0.522,\"published_preserved_tail_m\":0.364,\"measurement_status\":\"Hu etal2005 IVPP V14155 measurements.\",\"head_model_m\":0.175,\"trunk_model_m\":0.522,\"tail_model_m\":0.39,\"shoulder_model_m\":0.23,\"model_status\":\"Fleshed head/tail/shoulder are conservative original estimates; trunk follows published dimension. Overall about1.087m, not claimed exact living measurement.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Low long robust torso with short stout semi-erect limbs, not long-legged running dog or extremely sprawling lizard.\",\"Large elongate heavy head with thick mandible and broad rear cheek/temporal volume; no tiny shrew head or modern blunt pug face.\",\"Strong neck continuous with substantial shoulders, distinguish jaw depth from body mass.\",\"Short broad plantigrade feet inferred from congener; small separated toes/claws, no hooves or flippers.\",\"Long tapering cylindrical tail, not Castorocauda paddle or a modern badger short stump.\",\"Neutral inferred fur and small rounded ears; no modern badger mask, striped back or asserted fossil coat pattern.\"]}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole robust low-bodied mammal with a large head and strong jaws, reconstructed mainly from IVPP V14155, with explicitly comparative hand/foot reconstruction from congeneric R.robustus.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"V14155 preserves partial skull and articulated postcranium, but lacks manus and pes. Short broad plantigrade hands/feet are inferred using R.robustus V13605, not directly preserved in the modeled individual. Fur, ears, color and flesh are inferred. Tail364mm is preserved length, not certified complete tail. Mass12-14kg is regression estimate. Dinosaur stomach remains belong to R.robustus, not V14155.\",\"zh\":\"V14155保存部分颅骨与关联骨架，但手足缺失。短宽跖行手足按同属R.robustus V13605比较推断，并非目标个体实证。毛、耳、颜色及软组织为复原；364毫米是保存尾长，非完整尾长保证。12至14千克为回归估计；恐龙胃内容物属于R.robustus，不属于V14155。\"},\"original_inventory_ordinal\":661,\"taxon\":\"Repenomamus giganticus\",\"classification\":\"Eutriconodonta, Mammalia; extinct non-therian mammal, not a modern badger or rodent\",\"scale\":{\"unit\":\"meter\",\"published_skull_m\":0.16,\"published_trunk_m\":0.522,\"published_preserved_tail_m\":0.364,\"measurement_status\":\"Hu etal2005 IVPP V14155 measurements.\",\"head_model_m\":0.175,\"trunk_model_m\":0.522,\"tail_model_m\":0.39,\"shoulder_model_m\":0.23,\"model_status\":\"Fleshed head/tail/shoulder are conservative original estimates; trunk follows published dimension. Overall about1.087m, not claimed exact living measurement.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Low long robust torso with short stout semi-erect limbs, not long-legged running dog or extremely sprawling lizard.\",\"Large elongate heavy head with thick mandible and broad rear cheek/temporal volume; no tiny shrew head or modern blunt pug face.\",\"Strong neck continuous with substantial shoulders, distinguish jaw depth from body mass.\",\"Short broad plantigrade feet inferred from congener; small separated toes/claws, no hooves or flippers.\",\"Long tapering cylindrical tail, not Castorocauda paddle or a modern badger short stump.\",\"Neutral inferred fur and small rounded ears; no modern badger mask, striped back or asserted fossil coat pattern.\"]}"
  },
